This directory contains a modified copy of the dsh-context client
(src/shared/*, src/client/*): the cordis plugin shell, session-projection
bindings, harness remotes, and the models.dev price fetch were removed or
replaced; data arrives from the claude-code-java gateway instead. Every file
that departs from upstream carries a "claude-code-java" note at the change.
See webui/UPSTREAM.md for the per-file Kept/Cut ledger.
